ys wash my hands ___ I eat.","o":["before","after that","then"],"a":0,"why":"Rửa tay trước khi ăn → before."},{"k":"fill","stem":"We had lunch. ___ that, we went shopping.","o":["After","Before","When"],"a":0,"why":"After that = sau đó."},{"k":"fix","stem":"After I got home, then I took a shower.","o":["After I got home, I took a shower.","After I got home, then I take a shower.","After got home, I took a shower."],"a":0,"why":"Vế sau không cần then."},{"k":"choice","q":"Câu nào đúng dấu câu?","o":["When I got home, I had dinner.","When I got home I had, dinner.","When, I got home I had dinner."],"a":0,"why":"Mệnh đề thời gian đứng đầu → phẩy sau nó."},{"k":"type","stem":"___ we finished the game, we went for pizza. (Sau khi)","ans":["After"],"why":"Sau khi → After."},{"k":"transform","q":"Nối hai câu bằng when:","stem":"I got home. I called my mom.","o":["When I got home, I called my mom.","When I got home I called, my mom.","I got home when, I called my mom."],"a":0,"why":"When + mệnh đề, + mệnh đề."},{"k":"order","parts":["Brush","your","teeth","before","you","go","to","bed"],"end":".","vi":"Đánh răng trước khi đi ngủ nhé."},{"k":"listen","beat":11,"o":["After we finished the game, we went for pizza.","Before we finished the game, we went for pizza.","After we finish the game, we'll go for pizza."],"a":0,"en":1,"why":"Nghe after + finished."},{"k":"natural","o":["After I finished work, then I went home.","After I finished work, I went home."],"a":1}],"words":[{"id":"first","ipa":"fɝst","vi":"đầu tiên; thứ nhất; trước hết","level":0},{"id":"then","ipa":"ðɛn","vi":"sau đó; lúc đó; vậy thì","level":0},{"id":"finally","ipa":"ˈfaɪnəli","vi":"cuối cùng; rốt cuộc","level":1},{"id":"after","ipa":"ˈæftɚ","vi":"sau; sau khi; đằng sau","level":0},{"id":"before","ipa":"bɪˈfɔɹ","vi":"trước; trước khi; trước đây","level":0},{"id":"when","ipa":"wɛn","vi":"khi; khi nào; lúc","level":0},{"id":"miss","ipa":"mɪs","vi":"nhớ; bỏ lỡ; trượt","level":0},{"id":"drop","ipa":"dɹɑp","vi":"g